    "description": {
      "content": "The SwaggerHub Registry API provides programmatic access to all SwaggerHub resources: APIs, domains, integrations, projects, templates, and standardization rulesets. Use it to manage API versions, publish APIs, run CI/CD integrations, manage projects, and retrieve OpenAPI definitions.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: SmartBear SwaggerHub Support",
